# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/
# AGENTS.md §2 tells you to run `cargo test` under a separate CARGO_TARGET_DIR when
# `tauri dev` is running, so the two don't fight over the build lock. Only `/target/`
# was ignored, so doing as instructed left ~4,600 build artifacts staged by the next
# `git add -A` — which is exactly how they nearly went into a release commit.
/target-*/
/gen/schemas
